            <div xml:id="d14">

                <pb facs="0131" n="15" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg15"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811f.812/756a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">To the Diplomatic Officers of the United States in
                        Denmark, Greece, Guatemala, Honduras, Nicaragua, Panama and Uruguay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 3, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s telegram January 28 last. Communicate following to Minister of
                    Foreign Affairs:</p>
                <p>In view of intention that celebration formal opening Panama Canal should be a
                    fête in which whole world could take part, as it was to commemorate opening of
                    waterway for use of all nations, and because of present distressing conditions
                    throughout world, the Congress of the United States decided that, as this was
                    not a moment when nations of the world desired to participate in an
                    international fête, it was desirable to abandon original plan. The President,
                    therefore, will not proceed to Panama in July, and the ceremonies will
                    accordingly not take place.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
